题背熟了 并不是真的变强流 初级是为了测试改进后的harness的泛化能力","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"62067591ebf1e24a694f2ae4e058857787f4fadbc15d97cf898068d42d498cb5","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_c960e16025ab070a6c7b3230076a57219dd10384d21dee2f1cf473d10cc1c875","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null},{"span_id":"Q005_S2","video_id":"bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000063","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000064","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000065","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000066","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000067","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000068","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000069","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000070","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000071","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000072","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000073","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000074","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000075","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000076"],"start_time":138.35,"end_time":166.11,"quote_text":"第四步看trace做一个定向改动 trace就是agent执行任务时留下来的过程 记录他搜了什么 点了什么工具 在哪一步开始绕圈 如果trace显示它的问题是 不知道什么时候停止搜索 那这次改动就只针对这个问题 比如给工具说明加一条原则 当已有信息能覆盖用户目标时 停止搜索 并进入输出阶段 注意这里一次只改一个方向 不要同时改多个","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"62067591ebf1e24a694f2ae4e058857787f4fadbc15d97cf898068d42d498cb5","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_c960e16025ab070a6c7b3230076a57219dd10384d21dee2f1cf473d10cc1c875","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null},{"span_id":"Q005_S3","video_id":"bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000077","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000078","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000079","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000080","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000081","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000082","bilibili:BV1sudwBnEoP:run_000:seg_000083","